            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The new diagnostic options offered by the continuous development of CT and MR imaging of the heart must be periodically reviewed. This review article aims to outline the main developments in CT and MR technology and to evaluate the results and indications in CAD (coronary artery disease) patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
